title: Labour Inspection Is a Ministry Now
subtitle: Use office before the coalition reclaims the agenda.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and labor_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_labor_inspection_timer <= 0 and (labor_credibility < 85 or workers_support < 75)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_labor_inspection_timer = 4
card-image: img/poland/cards/labour-inspection.webp

= Labour inspection

[? if government_party = "pis": Morawiecki can praise enforcement in public.
PiS ministers become less enthusiastic when inspectors acquire the staff to
enter favoured employers' books.?]
[? if government_party != "pis": The coalition agrees on enforcement and
disputes the money.?]

[? if left_is_junior_partner = 1: **[+ coalition_senior_partner +] holds the
premiership.** The ministry is ours; the decision to let it act is not entirely
ours. Objection risk on a contested measure: **[+ coalition_objection_risk
+]%**.?]

- @fund
- @platform_work
- @target
- @memo

@fund
title: Fund inspectors and regional offices
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. The full staffing programme, and the one the coalition may refuse.
choose-if: budget >= 2 and labor_minister_party = "Lewica"
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Labour Ministry and two budget points.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget -= 2;
const objectionRoll = this.random.uint32() / 4294967296;
const objected =
    Q.left_is_junior_partner &&
    objectionRoll * 100 < Number(Q.coalition_objection_risk) * 1.05;
Q.last_card_objection = objected ? 1 : 0;
Q.last_card_objector = Q.coalition_senior_partner;
if (objected) {
    // Overruled: the posts are cut back to a pilot and the political cost
    // stays with us, because the announcement was ours.
    Q.labor_credibility += 2;
    Q.workers_support += 1;
    Q.government_delivery += 1;
    Q.labor_dissent += 4;
    Q.left_coalition_dissent += 6;
    Q.coalition_blur += 3;
    Q.government_coalition_dissent += 4;
    Q.ministry_overruled_count += 1;
    Q.ministry_overruled_last = "Labour inspection staffing";
    Q.government_goal_labor = 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        Q.coalition_senior_partner +
        " cuts the labour inspection programme back to a pilot";
} else {
    Q.labor_credibility += 7;
    Q.workers_support += 5;
    Q.government_delivery += 5;
    Q.administrative_capacity += 2;
    Q.government_goal_labor = 2;
    if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
        Q.government_coalition_dissent += 3;
        Q.pis_relation -= 2;
    } else {
        Q.ko_coalition_dissent += 4;
    }
    Q.news_headline =
        "Labour inspection receives staff, regional offices and enforcement power";
}
!}

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

[? if last_card_objection = 1: The letter arrives from the Chancellery before
the press conference does. The posts are approved at a quarter of the number,
the regional offices become "a pilot in two voivodeships", and the objection is
recorded as a budgetary reservation rather than a political one.?][? if
last_card_objection = 0: The inspectorate gets the posts, the regional offices
and the mandate to use them, which is the difference between a right and a right
somebody enforces.?]

[? if last_card_objection = 1: We keep the ministry and the announcement. The
union federations, who read the staffing annex, keep the receipt.?]

- #poland_card_finish


@platform_work
title: Open the platform and outsourcing files
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Reclassify the couriers, drivers and warehouse subcontractors PiS calls entrepreneurs.
choose-if: budget >= 1 and labor_minister_party = "Lewica"
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Labour Ministry and one budget point.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget -= 1;
const objectionRoll = this.random.uint32() / 4294967296;
const objected =
    Q.left_is_junior_partner &&
    objectionRoll * 100 < Number(Q.coalition_objection_risk) * 0.85;
Q.last_card_objection = objected ? 1 : 0;
Q.last_card_objector = Q.coalition_senior_partner;
Q.government_goal_labor = Math.max(1, Number(Q.government_goal_labor) || 0);
if (objected) {
    Q.labor_credibility += 2;
    Q.young_support += 1;
    Q.left_coalition_dissent += 5;
    Q.coalition_blur += 2;
    Q.ministry_overruled_count += 1;
    Q.ministry_overruled_last = "Platform work reclassification";
    Q.news_headline =
        Q.coalition_senior_partner +
        " sends the platform-work reclassification back for consultation";
} else {
    Q.labor_credibility += 5;
    Q.workers_support += 4;
    Q.young_support += 4;
    Q.anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 4;
    Q.industrial_logistics_left_affinity += 3;
    Q.government_delivery += 3;
    Q.konf_poll_momentum -= 0.2;
    Q.economic_issue_salience += 2;
    if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
        Q.pis_relation -= 3;
        Q.government_coalition_dissent += 4;
    } else {
        Q.ko_coalition_dissent += 3;
    }
    Q.news_headline =
        "Couriers, drivers and warehouse subcontractors are reclassified as employees";
}
!}

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

[? if last_card_objection = 0: The regulation covers the people the labour code
was written to exclude: the courier on a service contract, the driver renting
his own van from the firm that dispatches him, the warehouse crew hired through
three intermediaries. Every one of them is now inside the inspectorate's
jurisdiction.?][? if last_card_objection = 1: The reclassification goes to
consultation, where the employers' organisations have three months to explain why
courier work is a lifestyle. Nothing is withdrawn and nothing takes effect.?]

[? if last_card_objection = 0: Konfederacja has spent four years telling exactly
these workers that the state is their only enemy. The argument gets harder when
the state has just given them notice periods.?]

- #poland_card_finish


@target
title: Target wage theft with the existing staff
subtitle: No budget cost. A narrower campaign the coalition cannot refuse.
on-arrival: labor_credibility += 3; workers_support += 2; government_delivery += 2; industrial_logistics_left_affinity += 1; government_goal_labor = 1; last_card_objection = 0; news_headline = "Inspectors concentrate on wage theft"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

The existing inspectors are pointed at unpaid overtime and withheld wages,
which is the offence workers actually report. It requires no new posts and
therefore no coalition permission.

It also reaches only the employers already on a list. The subcontracting chains
that generate most of the complaints stay outside the inspectorate's reach.

- #poland_card_finish


@memo
title: Publish the enforcement gap instead of closing it
subtitle: Free. Honest, useful, and read by the unions as a ministry explaining why it will not act.
on-arrival: public_trust += 1; media_capacity += 1; ko_coalition_dissent += 2 if government_party != "pis"; government_coalition_dissent += 2 if government_party = "pis"; labor_dissent += 5; labor_credibility -= 2; workers_support -= 1; government_delivery -= 1; last_card_objection = 0; news_headline = "The ministry publishes the cost of inaction"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

The document is accurate: this many inspectors, this many workplaces, this many
years to reach each one. It shifts the responsibility to whoever refused the
posts.

The federations point out that the minister who published it is ours, and that
a ministry describing its own paralysis is still a paralysed ministry.

- #poland_card_finish
